Don't worry about it.  I have a big secret for you:

He always teleports to the next level you go to.  In fact, if your dog
falls thru a trap door, if you go upstairs, there it is.  It was a
known problem in 2.3.

-=> HOW the hell can i kill him and get the amulet of Yendor?????

Due to another bug, if the wiz has the amulet, he never attacks, he
just goes to another level (wimp!).  All you have to do is go
upstairs, take a shot at the wiz if in range (or wait for the wiz to
disappear if not), and repeat until you manage to kill him.  Or, level
teleport to level 1 and run up and down the level 2 stairs, taking
your shots as you get them.

In 3.0, the wiz never goes to another level unless he's following you,
and will not follow you to another level if he has the amulet.  3.0
creatures falling thru trap doors end up on the appropriate level.


